  "title": "Planning Architecture Modes & Motion Modeling",
  "diagramType": "subsystem-architecture",
  "description": "Internal architecture of the foundational Planning engines: Centralized Planner (eng-plan-centralized), Decentralized Planner (eng-plan-decentralized), Hybrid Planning Coordinator (eng-plan-hybrid), and Motion Model Engine (eng-plan-motion-model). Details the planning mode selection logic, delegation patterns between centralized and decentralized modes, automatic fallback on connectivity loss, and the vehicle kinematic/dynamic motion models that constrain all planning outputs. Shows integration with the Vehicle State Store, Core Event Bus, COP Orchestrator, and Network Routing Engine.",
