      "description": "Connectivity quality thresholds for automatic planning mode transitions (e.g., minimum link quality score, maximum latency, minimum bandwidth).",
      "impact": "Affects Hybrid Coordinator's mode selection sensitivity and the timing of fallback to decentralized planning.",
